OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits causing wrong-way
OL,4,Apolice chase crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drove the wrong way along the
OL,7,FA46 during a police chase has admitted
OL,8,Fseriously injuring another driver.
OL,10,FShortly after 04:00 BST on 29 June,
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police attempted to stop
OL,12,FNiks Rogacs, who was driving a white
OL,13,FMercedes van which had been reported
OL,14,Fstolen.
OL,16,FOfficers pursued the offender after he
OL,17,Ffled, but he drove on to the wrong side
OL,18,Fof the A46 before hitting a blue BMW 1
OL,19,FSeries near Glenfield.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
