OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits causing wrong-way
OL,4,Apolice chase crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FRogacs, 26, of Acacia Close, Leicester,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to one count of causing
OL,8,Fserious injury by dangerous driving and
OL,9,Ftwo counts of handling stolen goods at
OL,10,FLeicester Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
